        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we focus on our business of growing our Ground Lease platform, we seek to recruit new talent and provide training to existing employees to support our business strategy.",
        "start_character": 32718,
        "end_character": 32890
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001095651-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001095651-26-000010-4713adc72a95c514",
        "accession_number": "0001095651-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a publicly-traded company that operates our business through one reportable segment by acquiring, managing and capitalizing ground leases.",
        "start_character": 1894,
        "end_character": 2039
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001095651-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001095651-26-000010-4713adc72a95c514",
        "accession_number": "0001095651-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Market Opportunity: We believe that there is a significant market opportunity for a dedicated provider of Ground Lease capital like us.",
        "start_character": 18008,
        "end_character": 18143
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001095651-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001095651-26-000010-4713adc72a95c514",
        "accession_number": "0001095651-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also offer our professionals the opportunity to participate in a variety of development programs, including discussions led by outside speakers on topics of interest and a learning management tool that enables employees and their managers to select courses that enhance professional development.",
        "start_character": 33157,
        "end_character": 33455
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001095651-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001095651-26-000010-4713adc72a95c514",
        "accession_number": "0001095651-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that the market for existing Ground Leases is fragmented with ownership comprised primarily of high-net-worth individuals, pension funds, life insurance companies, estates and endowments.",
        "start_character": 18144,
        "end_character": 18342
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001095651-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001095651-26-000010-4713adc72a95c514",
        "accession_number": "0001095651-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We compete with numerous commercial developers, real estate companies (including other REITs), financial institutions (such as banks and insurance companies) and other investors (such as pension funds, investment funds, private companies and individuals) for investment opportunities and tenants.",
        "start_character": 29131,
        "end_character": 29427
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001095651-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001095651-26-000010-4713adc72a95c514",
        "accession_number": "0001095651-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have designed a compensation structure, including an array of benefits, that we believe is attractive to current and prospective personnel.",
        "start_character": 33014,
        "end_character": 33156
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001095651-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001095651-26-000010-4713adc72a95c514",
        "accession_number": "0001095651-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We intend to capture this market opportunity by utilizing multiple sourcing and origination channels, including manufacturing new Ground Leases with third-party owners and developers of commercial real estate and originating Ground Leases to provide capital for development and redevelopment.",
        "start_character": 18663,
        "end_character": 18955
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001095651-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001095651-26-000010-4713adc72a95c514",
        "accession_number": "0001095651-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We seek to acquire existing Ground Leases or options to acquire existing Ground Leases that are marketed for sale and actively solicit potential sellers and related property brokers of existing Ground Leases to engage in off-market transactions.",
        "start_character": 23754,
        "end_character": 23999
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001095651-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001095651-26-000010-4713adc72a95c514",
        "accession_number": "0001095651-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "However, we are entitled to deduct (i) unrecovered acquisition costs borne by Portfolio Holdings following the termination of an applicable Ground Lease by reason of defaults of tenants;",
        "start_character": 13789,
        "end_character": 13975
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001095651-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001095651-26-000010-4713adc72a95c514",
        "accession_number": "0001095651-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "However, due to our focus on Ground Leases located throughout the U.S., and because some of our competitors are locally and/or regionally focused, we do not always encounter the same competitors in each market.",
        "start_character": 29653,
        "end_character": 29863
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001095651-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001095651-26-000010-4713adc72a95c514",
        "accession_number": "0001095651-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "However, while we intend to pursue acquisitions of existing Ground Leases, our investment thesis is predicated, in part, on what we believe is an untapped market opportunity to expand the use of Ground Leases to a broader component of the approximately $7.0 trillion institutional commercial property market in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 18343,
        "end_character": 18662
      }
